OL,3,GNEWSAFire destroys part of rare newts'
OL,4,Ahabitat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which runs a fire-hit nature
OL,7,Freserve known for its large population
OL,8,Fof rare great crested newts said the
OL,9,Famphibians had "lost an important part
OL,10,Fof their home".
OL,12,FThe fire broke out at privately owned
OL,13,FHampton Nature Reserve, which is run by
OL,14,FFroglife, on Tuesday afternoon. At its
OL,15,Fheight nine crews battled the flames.
OL,17,FAbout 12 acres (4.8 hectares) of the
OL,18,F300-acre site (121 hectares) were
OL,19,Faffected by the fire, the cause of
OL,20,Fwhich is believed to be accidental,
OL,21,Fsaid Cambridgeshire Fire and Rescue
OL,22,FService.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
